     "title": "Agile Space Portal Robot",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Agile Space Portal Robot</h3> <p>Spatial Portal Robot – Guarantees reliable handling of your tools.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/4/csm_coraMeasure_LG_Detailansicht_Hubwagen_bestueckt_bd246c34d7.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Manual Pallet Jack",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Manual Pallet Jack</h3> <p>Pallet jack – delivers the »»smartPallet«« tool pallet for the automated measuring process. The pallet jack is controlled manually by an operator.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/7/csm_coraMeasure_LG_Detailansicht_Palletenablage_55bbd9a155.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Mobile »smartPallet« System",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Mobile »smartPallet« System</h3> <p>»smartPallet System« – for tool assembly in automation systems. Thanks to its innovative pallet technology, tools can be reliably loaded and then transported—either manually or automatedly—to the various systems. </p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/a/csm_coraMeasure_LG_Detailansicht_venturion_offene-Tuere_b14e2f56fd.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Precision presetting and measuring machine",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Precision presetting and measuring machine</h3> <p>»venturion« Presetting and Measuring Machine – for fully automated tool measurement.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/4/csm_coraMeasure_LG_Schutzzaun_19aad8e1c7.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Certified Safety Enclosure",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Certified Safety Enclosure</h3> <p>Safety Enclosure – Provides 360° all-around protection to ensure your system complies with the latest standards and guidelines. The safety enclosure is part of the automation system’s safety concept, which is certified according to the international standard IEC/EN 61010-1 and cNRTLus.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/5/csm_coraMeasure_LG_Detailansicht_Software_cockpit_alleine_0fd6dc4db5.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Server-based control software",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Server-based control software</h3> <p>Control software – for the operation of the automation system. The control software can be displayed on different display devices (monitor, tablet, or smartphone). </p> </figcaption>"
    }
